[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail--1-2m-engineering-projects-exhibition-epex-for-undergraduates-2026-201":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},201,"-1-2m-engineering-projects-exhibition-epex-for-undergraduates-2026-201","₦1.2m Engineering Projects Exhibition (epex) For Undergraduates 2026","\u003Cp>The Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) offers a sum of ₦1.2 million to the best three exhibitors and open to all undergraduate students in all tertiary institutions in Nigeria studying a STEM related course.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) 2025 Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcompetitions\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Competitions\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦1.2 million Prizes\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship and Career Guidance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visibility and Recognition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) for Undergraduates 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For 11 years, the Engineering Project Exhibition (EPEX) has served as the premier stage for showcasing groundbreaking innovations across \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fengineering-projects-exhibition-epex-program\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Science\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa>, Technology, Engineering, and Math.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This year, we evolve with our new theme: “Engineering for Impact: Prototyping Tomorrow’s Solutions.” This reflects our mission to move beyond theory and foster tangible, functional prototypes that solve the pressing challenges of our immediate environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>We invite students from Nigerian universities to present projects that embody technical excellence and social impact. This edition will converge STEM leaders, industry inventors, researchers, and developers to witness the transition of bold ideas into scalable business solutions.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As we look toward the future, we continue to uphold the legacy of our late founder, Abdulhakeem Temitope Abdulrahaman. This year’s exhibition is a testament to his enduring vision, a commitment to innovation that doesn’t just exist in a lab, but makes a profound and lasting impact on the world.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Prizes for the top three (3) winners of the EPEX Exhibition 2026 are awarded as follows;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>First Place: ₦600,000\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Second Place: ₦400,000\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Third Place: ₦200,000\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Eligible Programmes for EPEX Engineering Projects Exhibition 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Eligible programs for the EPEX Engineering Projects Exhibition 2026 includes students studying;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Science\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Technology\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mathematics courses \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Participating Universities for Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>All undergraduate students of recognized Nigerian universities who are enrolled in the courses listed above are eligible to apply.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate EPEX Engineering Projects Exhibition, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be undergraduate students in a tertiary institutions in Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be studying a STEM-related course.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Selection Process\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Project Criteria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Innovation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Feasibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Engineering\u002FSoftware relevance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Actual problem-solving power\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Engineering Projects Exhibition (EPEX) 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the button below to visit the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill out the application form and submit all required details and information about the project\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.epexseries.com\u002Fepex-registration\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.epexseries.com\u002Fepex-registration\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-02 13:37:52",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F1-2m-engineering-projects-exhibition-epex-for-undergraduates-2026\u002F69f5f0203d2327.63381373_screenshot 2026-05-02 130803.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F1-2m-engineering-projects-exhibition-epex-for-undergraduates-2026\u002F69f5f0203d2327.63381373_screenshot%202026-05-02%20130803.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2